@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

actor "Company Contact" as Contact
participant "Frontend\n(Angular)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as DB
participant "External Questionnaire\nSystem" as ExternalSystem

' Note about the email notification
note over Contact: Contact receives email\nnotification of survey assignment

Contact -> Frontend : Navigate to "My Surveys" portal
activate Frontend

Frontend -> API : GET /api/v1/surveys/active
activate API

API -> DB : Query active passages for company
activate DB
DB --> API : Return active survey passages
deactivate DB

API --> Frontend : 200 OK (List of passages)
deactivate API

Frontend --> Contact : Display active surveys
deactivate Frontend

Contact -> Frontend : Select specific survey
activate Frontend

Frontend -> API : GET /api/v1/surveys/{id}/details
activate API
API -> DB : Fetch deadlines & template path
activate DB
DB --> API : Return details
deactivate DB
API --> Frontend : 200 OK
deactivate API

Frontend --> Contact : Display "Download Template" & "Fill Questionnaire" buttons
deactivate Frontend

alt Optional: Offline Preparation
    Contact -> Frontend : Click "Download Template"
    Frontend --> Contact : Initiate template file download
end

Contact -> Frontend : Click "Fill Questionnaire"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> API : POST /api/v1/surveys/{id}/generate-access
activate API

API -> API : Generate anonymous UUID\n(based on user ID & passage ID)

API -> DB : Store UUID mapping securely
activate DB
DB --> API : Mapping saved
deactivate DB

API --> Frontend : 200 OK (Redirect URL with UUID)
deactivate API

Frontend --> Contact : Redirect browser to external system\n(e.g., external.system.com/survey?uuid=XYZ)
deactivate Frontend

Contact -> ExternalSystem : Land on external portal
activate ExternalSystem
ExternalSystem --> Contact : Display questionnaire (confidential state)

note over Contact, ExternalSystem
  Contact can now safely fill out the questionnaire,
  save progress, and return later using the same flow.
  No personal information is transferred.
end note

deactivate ExternalSystem
@enduml
